<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day of</p>
<p>the second and final test between Sri Lanka and Pakistan on</p>
<p>Tuesday:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 331 (A.de Silva 138 not out,</p>
<p>S.Jayasuriya 72)</p>
<p>Pakistan first innings 292 (Moin Khan 98; S.de Silva 5-85,</p>
<p>C.Vaas 4-60)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka second innings (overnight 102-0)</p>
<p>S.Jayasuriya c sub (A.Razzaq) b Saqlain  113</p>
<p>R.Arnold b Mushtaq				50</p>
<p>M.Atapattu run out				 4</p>
<p>A.de Silva not out			     103</p>
<p>A.Ranatunga st Elahi b Mushtaq		66</p>
<p>H.Tillekeratne not out			  24</p>
<p>Extras: (b-12 lb-6 w-1 nb-7)		  26</p>
<p>Total (for four wickets, declared)	 386</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-157 2-171 3-203 4-308</p>
<p>Bowling: Malik 9-2-33-0, Ijaz 5-0-18-0, Saqlain</p>
<p>42.5-4-171-1, Mushtaq 33-4-113-2, Mujtaba 6-0-33-0</p>
